  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InteractableObject
  titulo: Official Statement
  textoConteudo: 'Following a thorough investigation, the Central Park incident has
    been classified as an isolated software malfunction. No evidence of sabotage
    or malicious intent has been found.


    Stellar Minds Industries'
  distanciaInteracao: 1.5
--- !u!114 &4261734111310570336
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1277292574779240609}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e72a02e855ccaaf47b3e553c1f8300bb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InteractableObject
  titulo: Stellar Minds Stock ncreased 4%
  textoConteudo: 'Stellar Minds stock value increased 4% following confirmation that
    no systemic threat exists.


    The City News Netork appured that after the
    incident at the local park, the stock and shares value of Stellar Minds increased
    4% comparing to the last trimester.


    City Nes Network 16/06/3XXX'
  distanciaInteracao: 1.5
--- !u!114 &4261734111937131869
